WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.840
Why are this guy's irises shaped like ovals? Human irises are round. This is the selfie the

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:12.760
Department of Justice filed in federal court against the suspected White House correspondent's

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:18.780
dinner shooter. Let's take a closer look. Look at the watch. The edge of the watch face blurs into

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:26.640
his wrist. Real metal hardware has defined edges. Next, look at the CVS logo on the bag. The C is

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:33.200
only partially formed and the heart is smudged. Letters and logos that blur or appear partially

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:39.480
reconstructed are well-known markers of AI manipulation. Now look at this wire on the desk.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:45.740
It disappears, then reappears. AI tools consistently struggle with thin continuous

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:52.240
objects. And now the ammunition bag. Notice how the edge of the shoulder strap and the bag itself

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:58.100
dissolve into the bureau behind him. I'm not claiming this image is AI generated. I can't

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:03.580
prove that. But it contains at least five anomalies consistent with AI manipulation,

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:09.540
and it was included in a Department of Justice court filing. There's no federal requirement that

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:15.340
AI use and government imagery be labeled. And this administration has a documented history of

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:21.400
releasing digitally altered images. If we can't trust what the Department of Justice files in

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:26.900
federal court, what can we trust? That's not a conspiracy. That's a legitimate question,

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:32.280
and everyone should be asking why. Full breakdown on Substack. Link is in my bio.
